      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPANISH ARMADA (1) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (24.36) at this track in a Grade 5 over 425m. Makes plenty of appeal. SO GLAMOROUS (3) box seated off the lead and kept coming to win (24.33) at this track in Grade 5 over 425m. One of main contenders. CANYA VIVI (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (29.06) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. BEYOND EASY (7) hit the frame latest (23.07) when second at Geelong in a Grade 5. Has already won out of this draw.",
